�天记录通过“导入并刷新”读取默认聊天文件；这里仅查看历次导入记录。</p><div id="importHistory" class="history"></div></article><article class="panel scroll-panel"><p class="eyebrow">DICTIONARY</p><h2>物品词典</h2><p class="muted">别名和合理价格范围用于判断省略单位的广告。可直接编辑 JSON 后保存。</p><textarea id="itemsEditor" spellcheck="false"></textarea><button id="saveItems" class="button primary">封存词典</button></article></div><article class="panel scroll-panel imports-panel" id="parserMaintenance"><p class="eyebrow">MAINTENANCE</p><h2>解析规则维护</h2><p class="muted">解析规则升级后，需要对历史聊天记录重新扫描（回算）才能补齐新规则可识别的报价；日常导入与勘误不会自动触发回算。</p><div class="report-grid"><div><strong id="parserCurrentVersion">—</strong><small>当前规则版本</small></div><div><strong id="parserAppliedVersion">—</strong><small>已应用版本</small></div><div><strong id="parserNeedsReparse">—</strong><small>回算状态</small></div></div><button id="reparseButton" class="button primary" disabled>重新扫描历史行情</button></article><article class="panel scroll-panel manual-price-panel"><p class="eyebrow">MANUAL PRICE RECORD</p><h2>手动录入行情</h2><p class="muted">手动价格会作为已录入报价，参与对应收购或出售价的近三十日中位数计算。</p><div class="manual-price-form"><label>物品<input id="manualPriceItem" placeholder="例如：100级附魔宝珠" autocomplete="off"></label><label>价格方向<select id="manualPriceType"><option value="sell">玩家出售价</option><option value="buy">商人收购价</option></select></label><label>价格（万两）<input id="manualPriceValue" type="number" min="0" step="any" placeholder="例如：12500"></label><button id="saveManualPrice" class="button primary">录入手动价格</button></div><p class="note">录入前请确保物品已在词典中；需要更新价格时可再次录入，新记录会和其他有效报价一起参与中位数。</p></article><article class="panel scroll-panel publication-panel"><p class="eyebrow">PUBLICATION</p><h2>生成公开发布页</h2><p class="muted">将当前物价玉简和积分兑换生成只读静态快照。发布包不包含聊天记录、原始报价、词典或规则；生成后可先在本机预览，再上传到 GitHub Pages。</p><div class="publication-actions"><button id="buildPublication" class="button primary">生成发布包</button><a id="openPublicationPreview" class="button ghost" href="/publish-preview/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" hidden>预览发布页</a></div><p id="publicationStatus" class="note">尚未生成发布包。</p></article></section>
    <section id="view-points" class="view"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">POINT EXCHANGE LEDGER</p><h2>积分兑换</h2></div><p class="muted">手动指定价格优先于行情；未指定时按玩家出售价中位数、商人收购价中位数依次取价。</p></div><div id="pointShopTabs" class="point-shop-tabs" aria-label="积分商店"></div><section class="panel point-shop-panel"><div class="point-shop-toolbar"><div><p id="pointShopDescription" class="muted"></p><small id="pointShopHint" class="point-shop-hint"></small></div><div class="point-shop-actions maint-only"><button id="addPointItem" class="button ghost">新增兑换物</button><button id="savePointShops" class="button primary">保存积分表</button></div></div><div class="point-shop-table-wrap"><table class="point-shop-table"><thead><tr><th>兑换物</th><th class="point-priority-heading">所需积分</th><th class="point-priority-heading">参考价格</th><th class="point-priority-heading">每积分价值 ↓<br><small>万两 · 高到低</small></th><th>数量</th><th class="maint-only">备注</th><th class="maint-only" aria-label="删除"></th></tr></thead><tbody id="pointShopRows"></tbody></table></div><div id="pointShopEmpty" class="empty">尚未录入兑换物。可按截图逐项新增，积分价格暂可留空。</div></section></section>
    <section id="view-terms" class="view"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ITEM RULE LEDGER</p><h2>物品规则校对</h2></div><p class="muted">按物品查看当前解析器真正采用的识别、收售、单位与区间判断。规则只读，校对标记仅保存在本机。</p></div><div class="rule-metrics"